  "description": "IZAWOY crystallizes in the hexagonal crystal system with space group P 63. Reported CIF formula moiety: C300 H300 La12 N24 O120. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La7 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La8 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La9 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La10 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La11 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La12 (La) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 6 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.132-4.245 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 100.87-110.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La12L8(O2C)12·24H2O]·n(solvent).",
